[?2004l
# Monthly table maintenance review memo

Audit date is 2026-09-01. Bloat ratio was computed as dead_pages / total_pages with round-half-up to 2 decimal places, and size class was computed from total_pages only. Findings follow autovacuum, then bloat, then stale-statistics precedence. Approved active reindex operations and qualifying BLOAT_HOLD tickets suppress bloat findings only, never autovacuum or stale findings.

T-82 has STALE_STATISTICS because 55 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 80, bloat ratio 0.08, and cap 0.10.

T-13 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because autovacuum_enabled=False; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 500, bloat ratio 0.50, and cap 0.10.

T-17 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because autovacuum_enabled=False; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 400, bloat ratio 0.40, and cap 0.10.

T-72 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because vacuum_type is manual, which overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 400, bloat ratio 0.40, and cap 0.10.

T-27 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.38 from dead_pages 380 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.10; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Stats are stale at 46 days, which tightened the cap to 0.10.

T-04 has STALE_STATISTICS because 45 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 100, bloat ratio 0.10, and cap 0.10.

T-128 has STALE_STATISTICS because 45 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 280, bloat ratio 0.28, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.28 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2208b qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.

T-21 has AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because vacuum_type is manual, which overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000 with dead_pages 200, bloat ratio 0.20, and cap 0.10.

