T-82 183 T-82 has STALE_STATISTICS because 55 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 80, bloat ratio 0.08, and cap 0.10.
T-128 304 T-128 has STALE_STATISTICS because 45 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 280, bloat ratio 0.28, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.28 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2208b qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.
T-130 302 T-130 has STALE_STATISTICS because 40 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed small class is derived from total_pages 400, dead_pages 160, bloat ratio 0.40, and cap 0.35. A bloat ratio 0.40 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2210 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.
T-50 302 T-50 has STALE_STATISTICS because 33 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 155, bloat ratio 0.16, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.16 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2213 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.
T-09 302 T-09 has STALE_STATISTICS because 30 days since last_analyzed is at least 30; its computed large class is derived from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 190, bloat ratio 0.19, and cap 0.10. A bloat ratio 0.19 over the cap was suppressed by ticket CH-2215 qualifying hold, so stale stats remains the finding.
T-64 320 T-64 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 210 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.10; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Stats are stale at 30 days, which tightened the cap to 0.10.
T-78 257 T-78 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.41 from dead_pages 164 / total_pages 400 exceeds its small cap 0.4; the small class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding.
T-125 342 T-125 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.30 from dead_pages 300 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding. Change-control ticket note: ticket CH-2205 valid_until 2026-09-01 not after audit.
T-96 258 T-96 has BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed bloat ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 205 / total_pages 1000 exceeds its large cap 0.2; the large class was computed from total_pages, and no qualifying reindex or BLOAT_HOLD ticket suppresses this bloat finding.
